  {
    "n": 40,
    "tag": "li",
    "text": "SAX (Simple API for XML) style API",
    "tokens": []
  },
  {
    "n": 41,
    "tag": "li",
    "text": "Similar to {1}, RapidJSON provides a event sequential access parser API ({2}). It also provides a generator API ({3}) which consumes the same set of events.",
    "tokens": [
      "<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Simple_API_for_XML\">SAX</a>",
      "<span class=\"tt\"><a class=\"el\" href=\"/docs/rapidjson/v1-1-0/en/02-reference/038-classrapidjson_1_1_generic_reader/\" title=\"SAX-style JSON parser. Use Reader for UTF8 encoding and default allocator.\">rapidjson::GenericReader</a></span>",
      "<span class=\"tt\"><a class=\"el\" href=\"/docs/rapidjson/v1-1-0/en/02-reference/058-classrapidjson_1_1_writer/\" title=\"JSON writer.\">rapidjson::Writer</a></span>"
    ]
  },
  {
    "n": 42,
    "tag": "li",
    "text": "DOM (Document Object Model) style API",
    "tokens": []
  },
  {
    "n": 43,
    "tag": "li",
    "text": "Similar to {1} for HTML/XML, RapidJSON can parse JSON into a DOM representation ({2}), for easy manipulation, and finally stringify back to JSON if needed.",
    "tokens": [
      "<a href=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Document_Object_Model\">DOM</a>",
      "<span class=\"tt\"><a class=\"el\" href=\"/docs/rapidjson/v1-1-0/en/02-reference/030-classrapidjson_1_1_generic_document/\" title=\"A document for parsing JSON text as DOM.\">rapidjson::GenericDocument</a></span>"
    ]
  },
  {
    "n": 44,
    "tag": "li",
    "text": "The DOM style API ({1}) is actually implemented with SAX style API ({2}). SAX is faster but sometimes DOM is easier. Users can pick their choices according to scenarios.",
    "tokens": [
      "<span class=\"tt\"><a class=\"el\" href=\"/docs/rapidjson/v1-1-0/en/02-reference/030-classrapidjson_1_1_generic_document/\" title=\"A document for parsing JSON text as DOM.\">rapidjson::GenericDocument</a></span>",
      "<span class=\"tt\"><a class=\"el\" href=\"/docs/rapidjson/v1-1-0/en/02-reference/038-classrapidjson_1_1_generic_reader/\" title=\"SAX-style JSON parser. Use Reader for UTF8 encoding and default allocator.\">rapidjson::GenericReader</a></span>"
    ]
  },
